    "text": "Choose the correct set of reagents for the following conversion<br />trans<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>Ph</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>&#160;cis&#160;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mi>Ph</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>"
